{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CueVdVgE0K1794321973.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國上月通脹表現高過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布，10月消費物價指數(CPI)按月上升百分之0.4，較市場預期高0.1個百分點。扣除能源和食品的核心消費物價指數，按月升幅維持於百分之0.3，亦高過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國政府去年10月停擺，當時數據收集工作中斷，美國勞工部因而今次沒有公布按年比較的數據。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.268676+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:05.061639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:25.370527+00:00","content_hash":"ba7d3c8b4116b92497018f51c958079cb005ccee5ae02942f1a3bd6c318af1c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.268676+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}